{"exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"scaleX":0.8,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","scaleY":0.8,"mirrow":false,"x":142,"trans":false,"y":-285.20000000000005,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","noIn":false},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"scaleX":0.8,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1","scaleY":0.8,"mirrow":false,"x":142,"transTime":0,"trans":false,"y":-285.20000000000005,"noOut":false,"bright":1,"addImg":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"timeBak":300},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]比起幽暗潮湿的黑森林，这里的气候实在是爽朗宜人，营地的设施也非常齐全，可以说除了附近的资源不太丰富，哪里都比黑森林要强。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]但是我毕竟是护林人的领袖，金弦之厅的树冠守望者。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]哪怕这里再好，我也不能在此定居，否则就是背叛了我的姓氏、我的责任、我的人民。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]当然，只要有空，我也一定会前来拜访。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]在这里我的内心感受到了难得的平静，好像一切困难都离我远去。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1a"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]当我走出这里回到属于我的岗位之时，这股平静将带给我更大的动力，让我能够更加有力地完成我的职责。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]更重要的是，在这里还有你，我的朋友。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]我永远记得你的帮助，也从不会怀疑我们的感情。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","img":"chara015_1_face_chara015_1b"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"芭杜尔","text":"[show]只要你需要，我随时都会飞奔而来。哪怕我回到了黑森林，我们的心也永远在一起。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"script":"sj_015_02","des":"芭杜尔-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}